@startuml
skin rose
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide empty description
title sd Website Timing
hide time-axis
scale 1 as 16 pixels
robust ":JSP" as JSP
robust ":Data Access" as DA
robust ":Servlet" as SV
robust ":DNS Resolver" as DNS
robust ":Web Browser" as WB
robust ":Web User" as WU
JSP has Processing
JSP has "Sending Response" as Sending
JSP has Waiting
DA has Processing,Waiting
SV has Processing,Waiting
DNS has Processing,Idle
WB has Waiting,Processing,Idle
WU has Viewing,Waiting,Idle
@0
JSP is Waiting
DA is Waiting
SV is Waiting
DNS is Idle
WB is Idle
WU is Idle
@16
WU is Waiting
@18
WB is Processing
@20
WB is Waiting
@22
DNS is Processing
@28
DNS is Idle
@30
WB is Processing
@32
WB is Idle
@36
SV is Processing
WB is Waiting
@40
SV is Waiting
DA is Processing
@46
DA is Waiting
@48
SV is Processing
@53
SV is Waiting
@56
JSP is Processing
@62
JSP is Sending
@69
WB is Processing
@70
JSP is Waiting
@74
WB is Idle
@77
WU is Viewing
@83
WU@16 -> WB@18 : URL
WB@20 -> DNS@22 : resolve URL
DNS@28 --> WB@30
WB@32 -> SV@36 : HTTP request
SV@40 -> DA@40 : get data
DA@46 --> SV@48
SV@53 -> JSP@56 : «forward»
JSP@62 --> WB@69 : HTTP response
WB@74 --> WU@77 : show page
DNS@22 <-> @28 : {0..500 ms}
WB@32 <-> @36 : {50..200 ms}
DA@40 <-> @46 : {200..700 ms}
JSP@56 <-> @62 : {10..100 ms}
JSP@62 <-> @70 : {100..500 ms}
WB@69 <-> @74 : {10..100 ms}
@enduml
